# NOTE=THE DIAGNOSTIC OBJECTIVE OF THIS BUILD SUCCEEDED. The 96-byte record in the sidecar (off_diag 0x10C0) holds the 32 raw bytes of the offending read verbatim: 0101010001010100010101000101010001010100010101000101010005050500. Seven of the eight replicas carry 0x0100 and the eighth carries 0x0500; the Start-up Disc reading (bytes 0x1D/0x1F) takes 0x0500 and GBI's bitwise majority takes 0x0100; the two differ by exactly 0x0400, the AUDIO source bit. The same bytes appear in the log line READDISAGREE, and the two channels agree byte for byte.
# NOTE=THIS SCRIPT IS A PREFIX, NOT THE RUN. It carries the 003A stage, the FOUR verify cycles and the teardown - the only parts whose transport operations the log records. The other 513 cycles are LEAN by design, so their operations were never written and are NOT invented here. The evidence for those cycles is the sidecar: 5 frame records of 40 semantic signatures each, 10 events, 17 sampled cycle records and 2 preserved AUDIO blocks. Header CRC bd2a5f27, total CRC 08514baa, both recomputed on analysis.
# NOTE=NO STRUCTURED STATE was observed in this run and none was expected: the abort came 0.084 s after capture start, and the logotype screen of vstate-0001 first appeared at 0.5014 s. FRAME_CAPTURE is valid up to the abort (5 frames, 4 complete, 1 incomplete, 2 resync) and BASELINE was established at 0.077 s. Nothing here revises the geometry, the table B match or the animation recorded from vstate-0001; this run neither confirms nor contradicts them, it simply stopped earlier.
# NOTE=THE MECHANISM IS STILL UNKNOWN. The bytes say WHAT was returned, not WHY. The transport reported rc=ok with the same 34 ticks and 9 polls as every other block read in the log, DSPCR 0804 before and after, INTSR bit 13 set at ISR entry and cleared by the handler's single W1C, INTMR bit 13 set at entry, latency 35 ticks. No transport error was observed. U-GBP-033 carries the open question.
